                            <keyword duration="135s" start="52497s" value=" sc 17"/>
                            <keyword duration="17300/2500s" start="1313334/25s" value="266 teachers leave for the day."/>
                            <keyword duration="3800/2500s" start="1313507/25s" value="267 you’re still here."/>
                            <keyword duration="18400/2500s" start="262709/5s" value="268 trying to get some study done. it’s so hard to focus with mum around right now."/>
                            <keyword duration="6500/2500s" start="1313729/25s" value="269 are you going to hendrix’s party?"/>
                            <keyword duration="5300/2500s" start="1313794/25s" value="270 not in the mood."/>
                            <keyword duration="9300/2500s" start="1313829/25s" value="271 what’s wrong?"/>
                            <keyword duration="7900/2500s" start="1313922/25s" value="272 liv’s in there with miss reyner."/>
                            <keyword duration="10500/2500s" start="1314001/25s" value="273 is she okay?"/>
                            <keyword duration="16200/2500s" start="1314106/25s" value="274 bit waffly - but he’s a good teacher."/>
                            <keyword duration="10900/2500s" start="1314268/25s" value="275 if i tell you something, do you promise not to breath a word of it - to anyone?"/>
                            <keyword duration="6000/2500s" start="1314377/25s" value="276 of course."/>
                            <keyword duration="10800/2500s" start="1314437/25s" value="277 i’m worried liv and muggleton might be having an affair....and that he’s got her pregnant."/>
                            <keyword duration="9300/2500s" start="262909/5s" value="278 that’s so wrong. why would you say that?"/>
                            <keyword duration="11400/2500s" start="1314638/25s" value="279 she’s getting secret messages from someone. someone older and who she shouldn’t be with."/>
                            <keyword duration="5300/2500s" start="1314752/25s" value="280 then i saw her get into muggleton’s car."/>
                            <keyword duration="5200/2500s" start="262961/5s" value="281 that is pretty dodgy."/>
                            <keyword duration="12000/2500s" start="1314857/25s" value="282 which is why i told ms reyner. she searched liv’s locker, and found a pregnancy test."/>
                            <keyword duration="10700/2500s" start="1314977/25s" value="283 it would explain why liv’s been acting so weird. "/>
                            <keyword duration="5400/2500s" start="1315071/25s" value="284 yashvi nods, troubled "/>
                            <keyword duration="10100/2500s" start="1315114/25s" value="285 they’ve been in there for ages. (guilty) you reckon i’ve made things worse? "/>
                            <keyword duration="16200/2500s" start="263043/5s" value="286 vi, he’s a teacher. if he’s going after a student, that makes him a predator."/>
                            <keyword duration="15100/2500s" start="1315377/25s" value="287 on their mutual concern."/>
                        </mc-clip>
